{title: Beeti Na Bitai Raina}
{artist: Lata Mangeshkar Bhupinder Singh R D Burman}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E] Beeti na bitai raina,        [F#] birha ki [B] jaai [E] raina
[A] Bheegi hui ankhi [E] yon ne,        [B] lakh bujhai [E] raina
[E] Beeti hui batiyan koi doh [A] raye,        [E] Bhule hue naamo se koi to bu [A] laye
[E] Chaand..ooho [A] ohoohoho [E] oo,        [F#] O chaand ki [B] bindi waali
Bindi waali [E] ratiyan,        [A] Jaagi hui ankhi [E] yon mein
[B] raat na aai [E] raina,        [E] Yug aate hain aur yug jaa [A] yein
[E] Chhoti chhoti yaadon ke,        pal nahin jaa [A] yein
[F#] Jhooth se,        [B] kaali laage laage kaali [E] ratiyan
[A] Roothi hui ankhi [E] yon ne,        [B] lakh manai [E] raina
